                  br
                  | Devices: Smartphones, Desktop, Game Console.
                ul.team-radial-bar
                  li
                    div(data="96")
                    | iOS
                  li
                    div(data="75")
                    | Games
                  li
                    div(data="92")
                    | Tools
                h4 Superpower
                p Prototyper++
              li.wow.fadeIn
                h3 Mr White
                p
                  | Master in beautifying mobile apps & improving user flow.
                  br
                  | Devices : Smartphones, Desktop, Wearable, Game Console.
                ul.team-radial-bar
                  li
                    div(data="93")
                    | iOS/Android
                  li
                    div(data="95")
                    | User XP
                  li
                    div(data="87")
                    | Wearable
                h4 Superpower
                p Mobile UserXP++
              li
                h3 Mr Black
                p
                  | Stream and Distribute everything on social, semantic and device networks.
                  br
                  | Devices : Server, Web, Smartphone, TV, WoT.
                ul.team-radial-bar
                  li
                    div(data="92")
                    | Realtime
                  li
                    div(data="98")
                    | Platform
                  li
                    div(data="90")
                    | Infrastructure
                h4 Superpower
                p Experimenter++
              li.wow.fadeIn
                h3 Mr Crimson
                p Strong Product and UX/UI Designer.
                ul.team-radial-bar
                  li
                    div(data="95")
                    | Web UI
                  li
                    div(data="91")
                    | Web Mobile
                  li
                    div(data="89")
                    | Backend
                h4 Superpower
                p Web UserXP++
              li.wow.fadeIn
                h3 Mr Silver
                p Creativity Designer.
                ul.team-radial-bar
                  li
                    div(data="92")
                    | Illustrator
                  li
                    div(data="88")
                    | Photoshop
                  li
                    div(data="84")
                    | HTML5 / CSS3
                h4 Superpower
                p Impressive++
        .overlay
